guiText.tooltip.BLACKLIST.1=Whitelist${br}The module will run only if the filter matches.${br}An empty whitelist will never allow the module to run.
guiText.tooltip.BLACKLIST.2=Blacklist${br}The module will not run if the filter matches.${br}An empty blacklist will always allow the module to run.
guiText.tooltip.IGNORE_DAMAGE.1=Match Item Damage${br}Distinguish between damageable items of the same type with different damage levels
guiText.tooltip.IGNORE_DAMAGE.2=Ignore Item Damage${br}Treat damageable items of the same type but different damage levels as the same
guiText.tooltip.IGNORE_TAGS.1=Tag Matching Enabled${br}Items in the same tag group as any item in the filter will match, e.g. oak and birch logs
guiText.tooltip.IGNORE_TAGS.2=Tag Matching Disabled
guiText.tooltip.eco.false=Eco Mode §edisabled ${br}§7Router will always run at normal speed.
guiText.tooltip.eco.true=Eco Mode §aenabled ${br}§7If router is idle for >%f seconds, it will enter low-power mode and only run every %f seconds. It will leave low-power mode upon processing any item and return to running at normal speed.
