guiText.tooltip.fluidRegulatorTooltip=§bFluid Regulation Enabled${br}When outputting: only output when the target tank contains less than this amount.${br}When extracting: only extract when the target tank contains more than this amount.
guiText.popup.filter=§a§nFilter Slots${br}${br}§rPlace items here to define the module filter. The module only runs when its filter rules allow it.
