itemText.usage.item.breakerModule=Breaks a block adjacent to the router in the module's configured direction, pulling it as an item into the router's buffer.
itemText.usage.item.dropperModule=Drops items from the router's buffer in the module's configured direction.
itemText.usage.item.placerModule=Places an item from the router's buffer as a block in the module's configured direction, if possible.
itemText.usage.item.pullerModule=Extracts items from an adjacent inventory in the module's configured direction into the router's buffer.
itemText.usage.item.puller2Module=Extracts items from any nearby inventory into the router's buffer.
itemText.usage.item.sender1Module=Pushes items from the router's buffer to the targeted inventory in a straight line. Opaque blocks can prevent the transfer.
itemText.usage.item.sender2Module=Pushes items from the router's buffer to a nearby inventory. The transfer can pass through blocks.
itemText.usage.item.sender3Module=Pushes items from the router's buffer to any inventory, including across dimensions.
itemText.usage.item.vacuumModule=Pulls dropped items from the world into the router's buffer. With no direction configured, it collects from any direction.
itemText.usage.item.voidModule=§c*** WARNING ***${br}Permanently destroys items in the router's buffer!
itemText.usage.item.detectorModule=Emits a redstone signal from the router in the module's configured direction if the buffer item passes the filter.
itemText.usage.item.flingerModule=Throws items from the router's buffer over potentially long distances. Adjust speed, pitch and yaw in the module GUI.
itemText.usage.item.playerModule=Remotely transfers items between a player's inventory and the router's buffer.
itemText.usage.item.extruderModule=Places or removes blocks in a line along the module's direction, depending on the router's redstone signal.
itemText.usage.item.extruder2Module=Operates like the Extruder Mk1, but places template blocks from an internal pattern buffer instead of real blocks from the router's buffer.
itemText.usage.item.fluidModule=Transfers fluids into or out of the router to or from an adjacent block in the module's direction.${br}The router's buffer must contain a fluid container item.
itemText.usage.item.fluid2Module=Transfers fluids into or out of the router to or from any nearby block.${br}The router's buffer must contain a fluid container item.
itemText.usage.item.activatorModule=Simulates right-clicking blocks and entities using the items in the router's buffer. Acts as a fake player.
itemText.usage.item.distributorModule=Distributes items from the router's buffer to multiple inventories, with a choice of round-robin, random, nearest-first or furthest-first.
itemText.usage.item.creativeModule=Creates items out of thin air and inserts them into the router's buffer.
itemText.usage.item.energy_distributorModule=Distributes RF energy from the router or an energy-containing buffer item to nearby energy-containing blocks.
itemText.usage.item.energy_outputModule=Pushes RF energy from the router or an energy-containing buffer item to the module's target.
